<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <!-- Target Framework: .NET 10 is not yet released. Using net8.0 or net9.0 as valid options -->
    <!-- If you meant .NET 8.0, use net8.0. If you meant .NET 9.0, use net9.0 -->
    <!-- Assuming this should be .NET 8.0 (latest LTS) or .NET 9.0 (latest stable) -->
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <RootNamespace>AphaBatchJobs.Core</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>AphaBatchJobs.Core</AssemblyName>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Add LangVersion for explicit C# version control -->
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable deterministic builds for reproducibility -->
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable trimming support for smaller container images in ECS Fargate -->
    <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Generate XML documentation for better code maintainability -->
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1591</NoWarn><!-- Suppress missing XML comment warnings -->
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable NuGet package validation -->
    <EnablePackageValidation>true</EnablePackageValidation>
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Treat warnings as errors in production code -->
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>false</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <WarningsAsErrors />
    
    <!-- Best Practice: Enable nullable reference types analysis -->
    <AnalysisLevel>latest</AnalysisLevel>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Best Practice: Add ItemGroup for common analyzers (optional but recommended) -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Uncomment when needed for code quality -->
    <!-- <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.NetAnalyzers" Version="8.*" PrivateAssets="all" /> -->
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>


**Key Changes Made:**

1. **TargetFramework Correction**: Changed from `net10.0` (which doesn't exist) to `net8.0` (latest LTS version). If you need .NET 9, use `net9.0`.

2. **LangVersion**: Added explicit C# language version control for consistency across environments.

3. **Deterministic Builds**: Enabled for reproducible builds, crucial for containerized applications in AWS ECS Fargate.

4. **IsTrimmable**: Enabled to support IL trimming, which reduces container image size - important for faster deployments in ECS Fargate.

5. **Documentation**: Enabled XML documentation generation for better code maintainability.

6. **Package Validation**: Enabled for better NuGet package management.

7. **Analysis Level**: Set to latest for best code analysis and nullable reference type checking.

8. **CI/CD Support**: Added ContinuousIntegrationBuild property for better CI/CD pipeline integration.

These changes align with .NET best practices for containerized applications running on AWS ECS Fargate, focusing on smaller image sizes, reproducible builds, and code quality.